				"When placed adjacent to any inventory, Packagers can create Cardboard Packages from the inventory they’re attached to. The process does not require extra materials."
				""
				"When powered with a Redstone signal, the packager attempts to fill the package as much as possible. A Cardboard Package has 9 slots of inventory. Placing a written sign on the Packager labels the created Cardboard Package with an address to be sent to."
				""
				"When a Stock Link is placed on a Packager, the Packager can receive requests from a Logistics Network. It can create packages with an address, specific items, and a specific amount of items."
				""
				"The Re-Packager is used to merge multiple Cardboard Packages that contain one recipe for a Mechanical Crafter."
			]
			id: "67B38F75568A3EA1"
			min_required_tasks: 1
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "333D682F91104DC5"
					item: "create:packager"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "419B39ED1AF31180"
					item: "create:repackager"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			x: 22.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4CC3F21F326F4047"]
			description: [
				"The Redstone Requester is used to request Packages from linked Packagers."
				""
				"Right-click a Stock Link or a Stock Ticker with the Redstone Requester to connect it to the Logistics Network, then place it."
				""
				"The Redstone Requester’s request can be configured in its menu. It can request up to 256 of 9 different item types to be delivered to a specified Address."
				""
				"When powered with a redstone signal, the requester makes the request set in its UI. If the desired items are not found on the network, the request is not made."
			]
			id: "2A49D15401AAC53C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "06FAC9846D0147BB"
				item: "create:redstone_requester"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 8.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4CC3F21F326F4047"]
			description: [
				"A Stock Ticker is used to request items from a Logistics Network."
				""
				"Click a Stock Link with the Stock Ticker to connect it to that network. Place a Mob in a Seat or a Blaze Burner behind the Stock Ticker to turn it into a Stock Keeper"
				""
				"The Stock Keeper can see all the items on the network. The UI displays how many Stock Links are connected. If the Stock Keeper is left unlocked, players can search the network, request items, and give their requests an Address to be sent to."
			]
			id: "5EFF6E91F1D53CDF"
			tasks: [{
				id: "78C31B2A22A883A4"
				item: "create:stock_ticker"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 12.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74837414C3A22899"]
			description: ["Blaze Burners must have Blazes in them to function. To put a Blaze in an Empty Blaze Burner, right-click on a Blaze while holding an Empty Blaze Burner. Alternatively, an Empty Blaze Burner can be filled by right-clicking on a Blaze Spawner. This method can be repeated without risk of destroying the Blaze Spawner."]
			id: "0D3FC2B68B1E2478"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0B2FC52C5D90292E"
				item: "create:empty_blaze_burner"
