			description: [
				"Linear Chassis will automatically connect to adjacent and equally aligned chassis. Slime Balls or Super Glue are needed to connect a column of other blocks to either of their piston-like surfaces."
				""
				"Unlike Linear Chassis, the Radial Chassis connects to a radius of blocks around it rather than a straight line of blocks. This can be unwieldy if there are blocks nearby one would rather not connect to the Contraption. You can right click on the sides of the chassis while holding a Slimeball or Super Glue to make them sticky."
